WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.347
CCS recovers a direction in a model's activations
encoding whether a statement is true or false,

00:00:06.427 --> 00:00:11.702
using no labels, only the constraint that a
statement and its negation disagree.

00:00:11.782 --> 00:00:15.585
Yet nobody had pinned down what its loss really optimizes,

00:00:15.665 --> 00:00:17.660
or whether that target is best.
